     "description": "Starbucks is a leading multinational coffeehouse chain known for its signature roasts, handcrafted beverages, and focus on creating a welcoming community atmosphere. Founded in Seattle\u2019s Pike Place Market in 1971, the brand has grown into a global institution that prioritizes human connection alongside high-quality coffee. Its business model relies on a widespread retail footprint, offering a consistent customer experience for millions of daily visitors worldwide. The company remains focused on ethical sourcing and professional barista training to maintain its market position as the standard-bearer for accessible, premium caf\u00e9 experiences.",
